                <mxCell id="20" parent="19" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="Executable file present in native machine language" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="320" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="25" parent="19" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1. To execute the bin file, OS always checks its env paths directories, in order wise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Whichever bin file is found first will be executed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
