                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="29" parent="26" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;So when we&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 204));&quot;&gt; dont want explicitly execute the script with its respective binary&lt;/span&gt;, we can add the shebang of that binary at the top of the file,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Now that script will automaticallly alway get execute with that shebang mentioned binary using just the file name&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
